classDiagram
  class Student {
    +String indexNumber
    +login(indexNumber)
    +logout()
  }
  class IDPost {
    +String id
    +String kind  "found or lost"
    +String idType
    +String holder
    +String place
    +String detail
    +String note
    +String photo
    +String whatsapp
    +String owner
    +Number created
    +Boolean resolved
  }
  class AuthService {
    +validate(indexNumber) Boolean
    +createSession(indexNumber)
    +endSession()
  }
  class PostService {
    +load() IDPost[]
    +add(post)
    +toggleResolved(id)
    +remove(id)
    +search(text, filter) IDPost[]
  }
  class Storage {
    <<browser>>
    sessionStorage upsa_user
    localStorage upsa_ids
  }
  Student "1" --> "0..*" IDPost : posts
  Student ..> AuthService : signs in with
  Student ..> PostService : uses
  AuthService --> Storage
  PostService --> Storage

---
sequenceDiagram
  actor S as Student
  participant L as Login page
  participant D as Dashboard
  participant DB as localStorage
  S->>L: Enter index number
  L->>L: Check 8 digits starting 103
  L->>D: Save session, open dashboard
  D->>DB: Read posts
  D-->>S: Show found and missing IDs
  S->>D: Search by name or ID type
  S->>D: Post "I found an ID" or "I lost my ID"
  D->>DB: Save post
  S->>D: Tap WhatsApp button on a post
  D-->>S: Open chat with the poster
  S->>D: Mark resolved or Remove (own posts only)
  D->>DB: Update or delete post
